    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        160,
        1777,
        2023,
        2087
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "1. Shall be the exclusive bargaining agent of the employees in such departmental bargaining unit concerning working conditions in such departmental bargaining unit, but the area of such representation shall not include salaries or salary grades, fringe benefits or other perquisites, promotions, time or leave rules, pay plan rules or regulations, appropriateness of titles assigned to a class of positions, appropriateness of titles assigned to a class of positions, appropriateness of the occupational group to which a class of positions is assigned, or any other city-wide issue; and",
