        2347
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. Shall have the exclusive right to present or process grievances on behalf of any employee in such departmental bargaining unit, provided however, that any individual employee in such departmental bargaining unit may present his own grievance either personally or through such departmental majority representative but not through any other employee organization.",
